    "match.wizard.howItWorksIntro": "This wizard turns a BIM/CAD model into a priced bill of quantities. Every model element is grouped, then each group is searched against a regional cost catalogue using multilingual semantic (vector) + keyword + rule-based matching. You review the ranked candidates, confirm them, and the wizard writes a real BOQ with real cost in the project currency.",
