    "correspondence.info_body_v2": "A contemporaneous register of every formal letter, notice, email, memo and report exchanged with project parties - the audit trail that protects you in disputes and claims. Log each entry, attach the source file, and link it to the related records.",
    "correspondence.label_attachments": "Attachments",
